warning[W0013]: negative `capacity` passed to `new`
  --> tests/ui/10-concurrency/channel/negative_capacity_warns.cheby:10:37
   |
10 |   let (tx, _) = channel::new::<Int>(-1)
   |                                     ^^ this `capacity` is negative
